<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-14T21:51:02.179Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 21:51:02 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Bandits have intensified attacks in Zamfara, killing soldiers and civilians, burning rice harvests and abducting residents, while gunmen killed a traditional ruler in Plateau and a Christian aid worker in Nigeria. In Kaduna, an Okada rider was killed and a motorcycle stolen, and suspected bandits advanced into a Niger community, prompting hundreds to flee. Islamist militants killed twelve, including a three-year-old, in Benue State. A boat carrying migrants from Nigeria sank off Djibouti, killing 140 migrants and sparking calls for action against irregular migration. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifkFVX3lxTE1HU3RuWFppRXNtbmRBUjFfSTEtOHZuemp2Z2V3aGdvY1A2U2pKMk8xOERPWGdWNWFuRk45Z2xUcUI5eGxBc2FsMDZTbFQtZldTTmdlNGp6MnhfemhVRHFlNktPclNNcVNGbDVlZjM0aTd2NlZZSzRsT2VRRy1Kdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxQczFfSFRPOG5EYXJNQTVMa0p2T0JRMXRXS0Npak1lS0x3RkRXVW1IS0xxZGpQQm9Fb1o4WlZwTWYxZmcyTUpOZnRRN05UWlBlMjY1elM0RHYzcUR4WkRuSFJtSkxVZkxBTmt4cDZoYlNtaGlPR1lZQTRTN1dWMTN3TElYenBPT0Jac3M5MVdZa0tPNlVrZ0t6NVUtZEpNQm_SAaYBQVVfeXFMTThsc2tsczlCTG1VX2ZpbW4yNXFMVFktU21lRUNsaDlNWHhOVGZTRVdJOS1faml2M2tkbS1tcnlsVUM4c2xLMDdsbVYyWVFiUWRyUG5PZGhESEtHbGFKaUl2UEV4QmdDd0NwRGsweGFzZWZCRElnNnh3OEs0bzN5bU45a2JFWmJSZHVUWDdjZVM5ZW12SDNFVzNaMWtwclp2bUN3WXl0UQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxQeGdNZEZvb3lrMGdSVGNOcl8zSXAzU3VfYUs1UHRZMHM2Q0VjeDhFRTlvaDB5N3JqclFYdzlmVUM5T0NDZ2c3YUVOTVlkWTFrSjhJSUxIRlBTeDR2ajkwakdBNHh1ZnEzZHJoaWJfZzNNYnlLX3IyQzB3czhGRG5OU3NDRWlWZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Post Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxONThFU2I3SmxoM2